---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

// Replace these before this page goes public. Keep it honest: the point is
// curiosity and progress, not sounding like you already know everything.
const email = "mmabayomi2208@gmail.com";
const github = "https://github.com/moAbayomi";
const linkedin = "https://www.linkedin.com/in/your-handle";
---

<Base
  title="Resume — Muhd Abayomi"
  description="A snapshot of what I've built so far and what I'm learning."
>
  <div class="max-w-[48rem]">
    <header class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-rule pb-4">
      <div>
        <h1 class="text-h2">Muhd Abayomi</h1>
        <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-meta text-muted">
          developer · osun, nigeria · open to work
        </p>
      </div>
      <a href="/resume.pdf" class="bracket-link font-mono text-meta">pdf</a>
    </header>

    <p class="mt-8 max-w-prose text-lede">
      I'm a developer who is still figuring things out, in public. This is a snapshot of
      what I've done so far and what I'm trying to get better at — not a claim that I
      know it all.
    </p>

    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-meta uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">now</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-body">
        <li>
          Looking for work and collaborations where I can learn from people better
          than me.
        </li>
        <li>
          Building and breaking small things on the web — see the
          <a href="/projects" class="bracket-link">projects</a> page.
        </li>
        <li>
          Getting comfortable with TypeScript, Postgres, and the unglamorous parts of
          shipping something real.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-meta uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">
        things i've built
      </h2>

      <div class="mt-4 space-y-6">
        <article>
          <h3 class="text-h3">This site</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-meta text-muted">
            Astro · Hono · Postgres · Cloudflare
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2 max-w-prose text-body text-muted">
            A personal wiki with a phone editor, wiki links, backlinks, revisions and
            search. I rebuilt it after an old server-rendered version turned into a bill
            and an outage. There is a
            <a href="/colophon" class="bracket-link">colophon</a> and a case study in the
            repository.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <h3 class="text-h3">[Project name]</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-meta text-muted">[Stack]</p>
          <p class="mt-2 max-w-prose text-body text-muted">
            [What it does, what you learned, and one result. A number if you have one.]
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-meta uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">
        where i've worked
      </h2>

      <div class="mt-4 space-y-5">
        <div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
            <h3 class="text-h3">[Role]</h3>
            <span class="font-mono text-meta text-muted">[Year] – [Year]</span>
          </div>
          <p class="font-mono text-meta text-muted">[Company]</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-body text-muted">
            <li>[What you did, and the result. A number if you have one.]</li>
            <li>[Another thing you did.]</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-meta uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">
        tools i reach for
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-prose text-body">
        TypeScript, JavaScript, Astro, Hono, Postgres, Cloudflare Workers/Pages/R2,
        Tailwind, Git. Comfortable learning whatever the problem needs.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-meta uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">learning</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-body">
        <li>[Book or course] — [what stuck]</li>
        <li>[Something you're practising right now]</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-meta uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">
        elsewhere
      </h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 font-mono text-meta">
        <li><a href={`mailto:${email}`} class="hover:text-accent">{email}</a></li>
        <li><a href={github} class="hover:text-accent">github.com/moAbayomi</a></li>
        <li><a href={linkedin} class="hover:text-accent">linkedin</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
